373:- **S5:** Which float operations does slice 26 need, and should NaN observations use (a) canonical arithmetic NaNs, (b) Wasm-style allowed-result sets with relational bit observations, or (c) bit-exact backend payloads as a named premise? Reviewers' proposal recommends (a). Source: `wip/std-placement` @ `abc648e4d`, `docs/proposals/STD_COVERAGE.md` (S5).
394:- **R0600:** Is the derived always-aborts fact placed at (a) slice 1, (b) slice 5 with removal from B1, or (c) split between a trivial `main` fact at 1 and call pruning at 5? Kimi and agy recommend (b); Codex recommends (c). Source: `wip/owner-questions-review` @ `11d9e6ee2`, `docs/proposals/OWNER_QUESTIONS_REVIEW.md` (R0600).
397:- **Showcase sketches:** Should paper showcase sketches be written before the freeze, or left to the compiled probes at their slices? The four-gate owner answer expressly did not include item 1, showcase sketches before the freeze, so no approval is recorded. Source: `PENDING_RECORDS.md`, the 2026-11-08 gates answer (no proposal branch or SHA recorded).
